        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akeshisa shiaDaudi khuMefiboshets",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi yareeba mbu Yatong'akhwo omundu yesi owomunzu yaSaulo, mbu emukholele akeshisa khulwa Yonatsani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yaliho omusumba undi owomunzu yaSaulo, oweliiralie mbu Ziba, nibamulanga ewaDaudi; omuruchi namureeba mbu Niwe Ziba? Naye nakalusia mbu Omusumbawo nisie ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi nareeba mbu Shialikhwoho omundu yesi weinzu yaSaulo, mbu emukholele akeshisa shiaNyasaye? Ziba namukalusia omuruchi ari Ashiliho omwana waYonatsani, owalema ebilenje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namureeba mbu Ali heena? Ziba namukalusia omuruchi ari Lola, ali munzu yaMakhiri waAmieli, eLodebari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omuruchi Daudi narumana okhumwenda munzu yaMakhiri waAmieli, okhurula eLodebari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Mefiboshetsi waYonatsani, omwana waSaulo, yeetsa ewaDaudi, nasikama nabunamia obwenibwe, namwinamila Daudi. Daudi namusunjila mbu Mefiboshetsi. Naye nafuchila mbu Omusumbawo ngwowuno! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi namusunjila mbu Oraria tawe; okhuba shindalachweya okhukhukholela akeshisa ta, khulwa Yonatsani so; khandi ndalakhukalusilia liloba liosi liaSaulo kuukawo; ne olaliitsanga ebiliibwa khumeesa yanje khatsotso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namwinamila, naboola ari Endi shiina isie omusumbawo, mbu umbenje imbwa ifu, shinga olwa endi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana omuruchi namulanga Ziba, omukholi waSaulo, namusunjila ari Biosi ebialinji biaSaulo, nende ebiabomunzuye bosi, emuheelesiye omwana womwamiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe olamulimilanga emikunda, iwe nende abaanabo, nende abakholibo; ne olamuleerelanga ebilarulangamwo, mbu omwana womwamiwo abe nende ebiliibwa ebia alia; ne Mefiboshetsi omwana womwamiwo alaliitsanga ebiliibwa khumeesa yanje tsindaalo tsiosi. Naye Ziba yali nende abaanabe ekhumi nabaraano, nende abakholibe amakhumi kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Ziba namusunjila omuruchi ari Shinga kosi olwa kali aka omwami wanje omuruchi alachile omusumbawe, nolwa omusumbawo alakholanga. Ne Mefiboshetsi yaliitsanga khumeesa yaDaudi, shinga mulala owokhubaana bomuruchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Mefiboshetsi yali nali nende omwanawe omutiiti, oweliiralie mbu Mika. Ne bosi abali nibamenyanga munzu yaZiba nibaba abasumba baMefiboshetsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Mefiboshetsi namenya eYerusalemu; okhuba yali naliitsanga khatsotselo khumeesa yomuruchi; ne yali omulema ebilenje biosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
